{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:ff14bdc9868dc6596cc52a9b5ffc3ddd881caabb1702aa7e5ee085c80e22a928","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"9ca233aedb48b328af4e072d409b29e9cef70b63cee689ea5cc0c9949e7e8278","raw_text_sha256":"a5990394532d8401421617d2adfbd07c3e9b3fd91c3c912f344f435d38afdb76","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":1692,"start":1673,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"text":"姻戚人等成服，皆大祭日除服，百日剃头。","text_sha256":"a5990394532d8401421617d2adfbd07c3e9b3fd91c3c912f344f435d38afdb76"},"before_sha256":"bedcfa8d7905194fe2c8c7c81d7bf58ba2527c89a49b0cac6b365b202c81e117","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"《钦定大清会典则例》卷八十九","url":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?chapter=677909&if=gb&remap=gb"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:e80fe29a87548bfca3201aa5fcdfbd0dc0f6ffb368a83e36db1c3a913735cfc4","sha256":"e80fe29a87548bfca3201aa5fcdfbd0dc0f6ffb368a83e36db1c3a913735cfc4"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:f49ee6d885a9c43508544fa7c703a53882314d53897b065a62ba2e31e78b2912","sha256":"f49ee6d885a9c43508544fa7c703a53882314d53897b065a62ba2e31e78b2912"},"id":"src:history:huidian:v89:huangguifei-mourning","locator":{"case":"雍正三年敦肃皇贵妃","section":"皇贵妃丧仪"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"证明妃嫔丧礼对姻戚另有专门成服规则；“大祭日/百日”等不得被机械等同于小说唯一婚期。","text":"皇貴妃宮中女子內監皆剪髮截髮辮成服婣戚人等成服皆大祭日除服百日剃頭。","text_sha256":"22e0f81ba328fbca9bfcab8179a3518565e7457f2e12ec68fe85c0049e44c621","title":"《钦定大清会典则例》卷八十九——皇贵妃丧仪","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"礼部·祠祭清吏司·丧礼三·皇贵妃丧仪","label":"《钦定大清会典则例》卷八十九","siglum":"HUIDIAN-V89"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h03:consort-special-rites","claim_sha256":"83c42e1c55c57baaeb77745102c821310d9efcb98b86fd3c83abd55b5ec09058","rationale":"被采用的同段姻戚成服、大祭日除服、百日剃头原句直接支持姻戚专门礼制安排；不依赖前句现代列举标点的解释。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h03:consort-special-rites","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"清代皇贵妃丧仪对姻戚另有成服、除服等专门礼制安排。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:huidian:v89:huangguifei-mourning"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"3bdb18412b993838a66bd60c4e38dde52f833205bda7d53a6702e1ff86590dc2","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["此项为代理对本地数字录文及下游主张的复核，不冒充独立人工评审；逐字重取不等于馆藏原件或历史真实性鉴定。","保留原Source ID、type、witness、tier、bibliography和notes，以及全部Claim、Decision、Implementation与TitleAxis记录和权限。","采用识典同卷替代数字载体；原ctext请求失败仍保留。现代标点和前句列举不承担此次Claim推理；未据此认定两个数字版本逐字同版。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"rationale":"将摘录收窄为同一皇贵妃丧仪段内直接支持现有主张的“姻戚人等成服”完整句。撤回旧繁体无标点整理，不为前句“皇贵妃、宫中女子、内监”的数字标点列举另作解释。段落标识为雍正三年敦肃皇贵妃丧仪；本句不增加小说婚期推断。","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:huidian:v89:huangguifei-mourning"}
